membr:Project_Montevecchio_2611041733_F2611041733 a rsrch:Finding ;
    RDFS:label "Preposition phrases with metaphorical meanings using the preposition OVER in Legal % Administrative texts in Early Modern English tend to be mostly used with regards to the Restraint Image Schema." ;
